## Data Pipeline Starter
An open-source data engineering project for building reliable data pipelines from CSV/API sources to MySQL, analytics, machine learning, APIs and dashboards.
## Architecture

CSV/API → Python → Validation → Cleaning → MySQL → ETL → Analytics → ML → API/Dashboard

## Current Status

Phase 1: Project Setup

## Technology Stack
- Python
- Pandas
- MySQL
- FastAPI
- pytest
- Docker
- GitHub Actions
- scikit-learn

## Getting Started
Clone the repository and create a Python virtual environment.

